00:33:05.114 --> 00:33:08.114
She has worked for public

00:33:08.518 --> 00:33:09.285
health departments including

00:33:09.285 --> 00:33:12.121
the san francisco department of

00:33:12.121 --> 00:33:12.788
public health, federally

00:33:12.788 --> 00:33:14.788
qualified health centers

00:33:16.590 --> 00:33:16.625
and other public agencies

00:33:16.625 --> 00:33:18.625
throughout california.

00:33:20.563 --> 00:33:21.230
DR. Malala has used this wealth

00:33:21.230 --> 00:33:21.831
of experience in her work

00:33:21.831 --> 00:33:23.831
leading san francisco's

00:33:23.967 --> 00:33:24.667
