00:33:24.667 --> 00:33:27.667
commission for the past five

00:33:28.338 --> 00:33:29.500
years and co-leads the

00:33:29.500 --> 00:33:31.405
california effort which got

00:33:32.442 --> 00:33:33.309
medi-cal to cover doula care.

00:33:33.309 --> 00:33:36.279
>> in addition to all of this,

00:33:36.279 --> 00:33:36.946
she continues to practice

00:33:36.946 --> 00:33:37.313
pediatric medicine and see

00:33:37.313 --> 00:33:39.313
patients.

00:33:40.283 --> 00:33:40.818
Zia and her mother are both

00:33:40.818 --> 00:33:42.818
from san francisco.

00:33:44.387 --> 00:33:45.122
And DR. Malala grew up mostly

00:33:45.122 --> 00:33:45.489
in the western addition and the

00:33:45.489 --> 00:33:47.489
fillmore.

00:33:48.591 --> 00:33:49.326
She attended john swett

00:33:49.326 --> 00:33:52.326
elementary school and went to

00:33:52.796 --> 00:33:53.330
lake wilmot high school when

00:33:53.330 --> 00:33:55.730
she had a baby.

00:33:56.465 --> 00:33:57.233
Oh, she left san francisco

00:33:57.233 --> 00:34:00.370
and she went to college in new

00:34:00.370 --> 00:34:00.738
york at columbia and then med

00:34:00.738 --> 00:34:03.707
school in residency at ucla

00:34:03.707 --> 00:34:04.475
when she had a baby.

00:34:04.475 --> 00:34:07.744
She came back home because she

00:34:07.744 --> 00:34:08.412
wanted him to have some of the

00:34:08.412 --> 00:34:10.812
same experiences growing up

00:34:10.847 --> 00:34:11.448
that she did.

00:34:11.448 --> 00:34:11.815
Upon returning to san

00:34:11.815 --> 00:34:12.549
francisco.

00:34:12.549 --> 00:34:15.118
She got a job at the bayview

00:34:15.118 --> 00:34:15.853
