00:34:15.853 --> 00:34:18.253
learned to integrate mental

00:34:18.923 --> 00:34:19.590
health care into her pediatrics

00:34:19.590 --> 00:34:21.990
practice to better support

00:34:22.126 --> 00:34:22.793
children who have experienced

00:34:22.793 --> 00:34:23.193
trauma in adverse childhood

00:34:23.193 --> 00:34:25.193
experiences.

00:34:26.763 --> 00:34:27.531
Growing up she attended many

00:34:27.531 --> 00:34:30.531
demonstrations in front of this

00:34:30.734 --> 00:34:32.734
