00:34:34.972 --> 00:34:36.972
engaged.

00:34:38.442 --> 00:34:39.143
It did not take long for her to

00:34:39.143 --> 00:34:41.543
recognize that good medical

00:34:41.546 --> 00:34:42.279
care alone cannot ensure

00:34:42.279 --> 00:34:45.279
