00:34:45.316 --> 00:34:45.883
healthy.

00:34:45.883 --> 00:34:47.883
Social justice work

00:34:49.190 --> 00:34:49.720
and political advocacy is also

00:34:49.720 --> 00:34:50.420
necessary to promote good

00:34:50.420 --> 00:34:52.820
health for kids experiencing

00:34:53.925 --> 00:34:54.692
racism.

00:34:54.692 --> 00:34:57.261
In 2016 she quit her job to

00:34:57.261 --> 00:34:57.995
accumulate more student debt

00:34:57.995 --> 00:35:01.310
and spent a year getting a

00:35:01.310 --> 00:35:01.399
master's in public health at uc

00:35:01.399 --> 00:35:02.990
