01:18:42.854 --> 01:18:45.230
talked to john f kennedy for

01:18:45.230 --> 01:18:45.623
about 20 minutes and ended up

01:18:45.623 --> 01:18:47.623
campaigning for him.

01:18:48.560 --> 01:18:49.227
Later in the 1960s, margaret

01:18:49.227 --> 01:18:51.797
