01:19:22.361 --> 01:19:24.761
Sadly, tragedy struck when

01:19:26.199 --> 01:19:26.833
their eldest daughter was

01:19:26.833 --> 01:19:28.833
diagnosed with cancer.

01:19:29.936 --> 01:19:30.436
Margaret cared for her until

01:19:30.436 --> 01:19:31.103
she passed away.

01:19:31.103 --> 01:19:34.103
And soon after her husband

01:19:34.440 --> 01:19:35.174
developed alzheimer's disease

01:19:35.174 --> 01:19:35.841
utilizing the skills from her

01:19:35.841 --> 01:19:38.711
first career as a nurse.

01:19:38.711 --> 01:19:41.447
>> margaret cared for paul for

01:19:41.447 --> 01:19:42.314
six difficult years describing

01:19:42.314 --> 01:19:42.614
it as the hardest job of her

01:19:42.614 --> 01:19:44.614
life.

