01:19:55.270 --> 01:19:57.863
group that she found community

01:19:57.863 --> 01:19:58.263
and others facing the same

01:19:58.263 --> 01:20:00.263
challenges.

01:20:01.534 --> 01:20:02.268
This experience brought

01:20:02.268 --> 01:20:05.268
margaret to her fourth career.

01:20:05.738 --> 01:20:06.372
In 2018, margaret founded

01:20:06.372 --> 01:20:08.772
senior power, a nonprofit

01:20:09.642 --> 01:20:10.310
dedicated to empowering seniors

01:20:10.310 --> 01:20:11.430
to care for their mental,

01:20:11.430 --> 01:20:13.443
physical and emotional health.

01:20:14.800 --> 01:20:14.413
>> and advocate for themselves

01:20:14.413 --> 01:20:16.413
