01:20:17.883 --> 01:20:18.618
>> senior power evolved out of

01:20:18.618 --> 01:20:21.254
necessity and blossomed into a

01:20:21.254 --> 01:20:21.922
beautiful community resource.

01:20:21.922 --> 01:20:22.622
When the pandemic closed a

01:20:22.622 --> 01:20:25.220
terrible police station for

01:20:25.291 --> 01:20:25.959
public meetings.

01:20:25.959 --> 01:20:26.559
Margaret transitioned their

01:20:26.559 --> 01:20:28.928
