01:20:40.941 --> 01:20:41.575
and U.S. School of law discuss

01:20:41.575 --> 01:20:42.175
general medical and legal

01:20:42.175 --> 01:20:44.575
topics while creating a

01:20:45.412 --> 01:20:47.812
community for sunset seniors.

01:20:48.715 --> 01:20:49.449
Margaret met dorothy lathan who

01:20:49.449 --> 01:20:52.819
I honored back in FEBRUARY for

01:20:52.819 --> 01:20:53.420
black history month and dorothy

01:20:53.420 --> 01:20:55.322
